## Common Set Operations

```python
favorites = {"python", "music", "travel"}

# Add an item
favorites.add("cooking")
print(favorites)   # {'python', 'music', 'travel', 'cooking'}

# Remove an item
favorites.remove("music")
print(favorites)   # {'python', 'travel', 'cooking'}

# Membership check (very fast even for large sets)
print("travel" in favorites)   # True
print("music" in favorites)    # False

# Set math
a = {1, 2, 3, 4}
b = {3, 4, 5, 6}

print(a | b)   # union:        {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}
print(a & b)   # intersection: {3, 4}
print(a - b)   # difference:   {1, 2}
```
